, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8742, "output_tokens": 194, "total_tokens": 8936}}, "model_output": "Continuing the pending pages toward the tool-use section (Toolformer, ToolBench).\n```python\nprint(recall([\"ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b\",\"ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62\",\"ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1\"]))\n```", "code_action": "print(recall([\"ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b\",\"ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62\",\"ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1\"]))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:22'}, {'id': 'ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:23'}, {'id': 'ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:24'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-e5b9499e130a976eefe2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:21'}, {'id': 'ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:22'}, {'id': 'ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:23'}, {'id': 'ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:24'}, {'id': 'ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:25'}, {'id': 'ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:26'}, {'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}], 'requested_count': 3, 'queued_count': 32, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8742, "output_tokens": 194, "total_tokens": 8936}, "is_final_answer": false}}
