24-26 delivered. Page 27 and beyond remain pending. Let me advance the read with the next batch.\n\n```python\nprint(recall([\"ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689\",\"ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f\",\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\",\"ev-2c646589154451e7b722\"]))\n```", "code_action": "print(recall([\"ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689\",\"ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f\",\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\",\"ev-2c646589154451e7b722\"]))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}, {'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}, {'id': 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:31'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}, {'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}, {'id': 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:31'}, {'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41048209f3096e51f36b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:34'}], 'requested_count': 5, 'queued_count': 26, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 9029, "output_tokens": 1002, "total_tokens": 10031}, "is_final_answer": false}}
