 {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8505, "output_tokens": 216, "total_tokens": 8721}}, "model_output": "Pages 27-28 cover assistant applications (not core answers). Continuing the pending batch to reach multi_agent and outlook sections.\n\n```python\nprint(recall([\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\",\"ev-2c646589154451e7b722\",\"ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055\",\"ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186\",\"ev-41048209f3096e51f36b\",\"ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2\",\"ev-345e6706309ac04ee927\"]))\n```", "code_action": "print(recall([\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\",\"ev-2c646589154451e7b722\",\"ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055\",\"ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186\",\"ev-41048209f3096e51f36b\",\"ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2\",\"ev-345e6706309ac04ee927\"]))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}, {'id': 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:31'}, {'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41048209f3096e51f36b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:34'}, {'id': 'ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:35'}, {'id': 'ev-345e6706309ac04ee927', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:36'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}, {'id': 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:31'}, {'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41