_tokens": 8840, "output_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 9144}}, "model_output": "Awaiting page 47 onward to confirm the Generative Agents evaluator count and Table 4 agenda topics.\n\n```python\nprint(recall([\"ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886\",\"ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495\",\"ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f\",\"ev-42cada09d7411017eb46\"]))\n```", "code_action": "print(recall([\"ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886\",\"ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495\",\"ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f\",\"ev-42cada09d7411017eb46\"]))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:47'}, {'id': 'ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:48'}, {'id': 'ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:49'}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:50'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:47'}, {'id': 'ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:48'}, {'id': 'ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:49'}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:50'}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:51'}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:52'}], 'requested_count': 4, 'queued_count': 6, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8840, "output_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 9144}, "is_final_answer": false}}
