rds, continual adversarial training and red-teaming, self-regulation, and benchmarks such as AgentHarm.\"\n\n```python\nr = write_note(title='outlook', content=\"Outlook notes (pp.51-52). Table 4 (p.51) lists five research agenda topics with challenges: 'Training Data' (finetune with inference-time reasoning data, convergent/stable RL, VLA/multimodal speech), 'Hallucination' (self verification, mechanistic interpretability, open-ended/open-world models), 'Agent Behavior' (scalable simulation infrastructure and role playing, distill reasoning to small models, models of agent/human behavior and emergent behavior), 'Self reflection' (in-model self reflection and metareasoning, metacognition/personality, automated scientific discovery) and 'Safety' (responsibility/liability, privacy/fairness, wider application areas). So agenda_topics = training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety. Conclusion (Sec.5.2, p.52): 'Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.' So shared_foundations = reasoning, self_verification. Safety (p.51) calls for multi-layer safeguards, continual adversarial training and red-teaming, self-regulation, and benchmarks such as AgentHarm.\", evidence_ids=['ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'], section='outlook')\nprint(r)\nrep = read_file('report.json')\nprint(rep['file_hash'], repr(rep['content'])[:300])\n```", "code_action": "r = write_note(title='outlook', content=\"Outlook notes (pp.51-52). Table 4 (p.51) lists five research agenda topics with challenges: 'Training Data' (finetune with inference-time reasoning data, convergent/stable RL, VLA/multimodal speech), 'Hallucination' (self verification, mechanistic interpretability, open-ended/open-world models), 'Agent Behavior' (scalable simulation infrastructure and role playing, distill reasoning to small models, models of agent/human behavior and emergent behavior), 'Self reflection' (in-model self reflection and metareasoning, metacognition/personality, automated scientific discovery) and 'Safety' (responsibility/liability, privacy/fairness, wider application areas). So agenda_topics = training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety. Conclusion (Sec.5.2, p.52): 'Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.' So shared_foundations = reasoning, self_verification. Safety (p.51) calls for multi-layer safeguards, continual adversarial training and red-teaming, self-regulation, and benchmarks such as AgentHarm.\", evidence_ids=['ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'], section='outlook')\nprint(r)\nrep = read_file('report.json')\nprint(rep['file_hash'], repr(rep['content'])[:300])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'outlook', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 1195}\n", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8266, "output_tokens": 1653, "total_tokens": 9919}, "is_final_answer": false}}
