summary\": \"多智能体主题区分协作与竞争。CAMEL 用 inception prompting 与角色描述让两个模型保持身份，无需持续人工提示即可合作，并通过对话把复杂问题拆成可管理步骤；此外还有创建者-批评者、宪法 AI、多智能体辩论与带裁判的 MAD 等模式。社会模拟方面，Generative Agents 用 100 名人类评估者判断行为是否可信，完整架构表现最好，但仍出现幻觉与反复行为；Sotopia、GovSim 等提供评测环境。局限是成本高、易角色漂移与错误放大。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 是单智能体流水线，未实现角色分工、辩论或批评者复核，多智能体协作仍属未来设想。可在写报告阶段加入批评者 agent 核对引文与页码。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"camel_prompting\",\n          \"page\": 37,\n          \"quote\": \"cooperatively drive a conversation without continuous human prompting. By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal by breaking down complex problems in manageable steps through dialogue.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\",\n          \"page\": 47,\n          \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"结论把未来工作整理为 Table 4 的五个议题：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self Reflection 与 Safety，分别关注用推理数据与稳定 RL 训练模型、自我验证与机制可解释性、可扩展的角色扮演与行为建模、模型内自反思与元认知、以及责任、隐私与公平等安全治理。作者强调各类能力共享基础：机器人与工具使用依赖有据的检索增强，社会交互依赖自我反思，而所有类别都受益于推理与自我验证。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已做 pytest 结构校验，但缺少答案级自验证与不确定性检测。可在写报告后增加一轮自检，核对引文是否为对应页连续原文，对应 Self Reflection 与 Hallucination 议题。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\n          \"training_data\",\n          \"hallucination\",\n          \"agent_behavior\",\n          \"self_reflection\",\n          \"safety\"\n        ],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"self_verification\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"agenda_topics\",\n          \"page\": 51,\n          \"quote\": \"Training Data Hallucination Agent Behavior Self Reflection Safety\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"shared_foundations\",\n          \"page\": 52,\n          \"quote\": \"Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "before_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356", "file_hash": "860d7d805b4051846d4607a87b466fd445954d618012183f260e97d6b0a81495", "changed": true}
